{"id": 2192, "title": "New Friend", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "new-friend-2", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2192_new-friend-2.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["今天在公司认识了一个新朋友，他是个中国人。晚上他带我去了一个中国饭馆，这是我第一次吃中国菜，很好吃，我很喜欢。他说周末可以教我做中国菜，我非常高兴。他是个很好的朋友，但是他的英语不好，我想我可以学习汉语，我们就可以交流更多了。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["今天在公司認識了一個新朋友，他是個中國人。晚上他帶我去了一個中國飯館，這是我第一次吃中國菜，很好吃，我很喜歡。他說週末可以教我做中國菜，我非常高興。他是個很好的朋友，但是他的英語不好，我想我可以學習漢語，我們就可以交流更多了。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["jīn tiān zài gōng sī rèn shi le yī gè xīn péng you， tā shì gè Zhōng guó rén。 wǎn shang tā dài wǒ qù le yī gè Zhōng guó fàn guǎn， zhè shì wǒ dì yī cì chī Zhōng guó cài， hěn hǎo chī， wǒ hěn xǐ huan。 tā shuō zhōu mò kě yǐ jiāo wǒ zuò Zhōng guó cài， wǒ fēi cháng gāo xìng。 tā shì gè hěn hǎo de péng you， dàn shì tā de Yīng yǔ bù hǎo， wǒ xiǎng wǒ kě yǐ xué xí Hàn yǔ， wǒ men jiù kě yǐ jiāo liú gèng duō le。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Today I met a new friend at work. He’s Chinese. In the evening, he took me to a Chinese restaurant. It was my first time eating Chinese food, and I thought it was delicious. I really liked it. He said he could teach me to cook Chinese food this weekend, which made me very happy. He’s a great friend, but his English isn’t very good. I think I can learn Chinese so we can talk more."], "english_full": "Today I met a new friend at work. He’s Chinese. In the evening, he took me to a Chinese restaurant. It was my first time eating Chinese food, and I thought it was delicious. I really liked it. He said he could teach me to cook Chinese food this weekend, which made me very happy. He’s a great friend, but his English isn’t very good. I think I can learn Chinese so we can talk more.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jīn tiān\" data-defn=\"today\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si